# Stack (mandatory)

- TypeScript throughout application layer
- Monorepo: `apps/web`, `apps/api`, `apps/worker`, `packages/*`
- Frontend: Next.js, React, Tailwind, MapLibre GL JS
- Backend: Fastify, REST `/api/v1/...`
- Database: PostgreSQL + PostGIS (hard requirement)
- Query layer: Kysely with SQL migrations
- Job queue: PostgreSQL-based (pg-boss), no Redis requirement in v1
- PDF: HTML/CSS templates + Playwright/Chromium (worker)
- Auth MVP: email + password (Argon2id), server-side sessions

# Conventions

- Parameterized SQL only; PostGIS operations may use explicit SQL
- Media never stored in PostgreSQL; use StorageProvider abstraction
- Strip EXIF from uploaded images
- Structured JSON logging with request id; no secrets in logs
- Private trips by default; public requires explicit opt-in
